      "creatureType": "construct",
      "blurb": "Hoshi: Kujaku Beast",
      "summonRole": "Kujaku Beast",
      "biography": "<p><em>Kujaku Art: Kujaku Beast (Hoshi Hijutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus or save DC when an effect calls for it. You command it as a Bonus Action. Irradiated: it gains its Radiation Aura.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct</strong> (1 size larger at B-Rank and at S-Rank). <strong>Armor Class</strong> 12 + 2 for every rank beyond D-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 20 + 15 for every rank beyond D-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft. (at B-Rank, 40 ft. fly).</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +3 (save +6), DEX +2 (+5), CON +3 (+6), INT −5 (−5), WIS −5 (−5), CHA −5 (−5). <strong>Damage Resistances</strong> Force, Bludgeoning, Piercing, Slashing. <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Chakra, Poison, Psychic. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, Bleeding, Exhaustion, Poisoned. <strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
    },
